{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long gcd(long long a, long long b) {\n    while (b) {\n        long long t = b;\n        b = a % b;\n        a = t;\n    }\n    return a;\n}\n\nlong long lcm(long long a, long long b) {\n    return a / gcd(a, b) * b;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long x, y, n;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n    \n    long long best_num = 1, best_den = 1;\n    double min_error = 1e18;\n    \n    if (y <= n) {\n        long long g = gcd(x, y);\n        x /= g;\n        y /= g;\n        cout << x << \"/\" << y;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    for (long long d = 1; d <= n; ++d) {\n        long long L = lcm(d, y);\n        long long numerator = x * (L / y);\n        long long step = L / d;\n        \n        // floor candidate\n        long long q1 = numerator / step;\n        long long approx1 = q1 * step;\n        double err1 = fabs((double)numerator - approx1) / L;\n        if (err1 < min_error) {\n            min_error = err1;\n            best_num = q1;\n            best_den = d;\n        }\n        \n        // ceil candidate\n        long long q2 = (numerator + step - 1) / step;\n        long long approx2 = q2 * step;\n        double err2 = fabs((double)numerator - approx2) / L;\n        if (err2 < min_error) {\n            min_error = err2;\n            best_num = q2;\n            best_den = d;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    long long g = gcd(best_num, best_den);\n    best_num /= g;\n    best_den /= g;\n    \n    cout << best_num << \"/\" << best_den;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long t = b;\n            b = a % b;\n            a = t;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    static long lcm(long a, long b) {\n        return a / gcd(a, b) * b;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long x = scanner.nextLong();\n        long y = scanner.nextLong();\n        long n = scanner.nextLong();\n        \n        long best_num = 1, best_den = 1;\n        double min_error = 1e18;\n        \n        if (y <= n) {\n            long g = gcd(x, y);\n            x /= g;\n            y /= g;\n            System.out.println(x + \"/\" + y);\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        for (long d = 1; d <= n; ++d) {\n            long L = lcm(d, y);\n            long numerator = x * (L / y);\n            long step = L / d;\n            \n            // floor candidate\n            long q1 = numerator / step;\n            long approx1 = q1 * step;\n            double err1 = Math.abs((double)numerator - approx1) / L;\n            if (err1 < min_error) {\n                min_error = err1;\n                best_num = q1;\n                best_den = d;\n            }\n            \n            // ceil candidate\n            long q2 = (numerator + step - 1) / step;\n            long approx2 = q2 * step;\n            double err2 = Math.abs((double)numerator - approx2) / L;\n            if (err2 < min_error) {\n                min_error = err2;\n                best_num = q2;\n                best_den = d;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long g = gcd(best_num, best_den);\n        best_num /= g;\n        best_den /= g;\n        \n        System.out.println(best_num + \"/\" + best_den);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00014768941036891192, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.0006862907321192324, -1.4185804502631072e-05, -0.0018020119750872254, -0.6808832287788391, -5.686121585313231e-05, -0.00011252723925281316, -0.04192878678441048, -0.2015020251274109, -6.651657167822123e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.8490614567999728e-05, -0.0008052920456975698, -0.00012361239350866526, -0.04321639612317085, -5.364403477869928e-06, -2.169585604860913e-05, -1.156323378381785e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.2159273865108844e-05, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -7.819823804311454e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00014208737411536276, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -1.7046782886609435e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -9.417489309271332e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.2811504602432251, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.622600959512056e-06, -1.3232143828645349e-05, -1.9907753085135482e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -5.9